flowchart LR
    Account[Account / session owner] -->|владеет| Project[Project aggregate]
    Project --> Branding[Branding base: heading / accent / logo]
    Branding --> Resolved[ResolvedBranding: theme / order / labels defaults]
    Project --> Testimonial[Testimonial: pending / approved / hidden / rejected]
    Testimonial --> Content[Неизменный text и photo]
    Testimonial --> Provenance[Source / platform / URL / screenshot]
    Resolved -->|presentation supplier| Form[Collect]
    Resolved -->|presentation supplier| Wall[Wall approved listing]
    Resolved -->|typed optional DTO| Widget[Widget latest50 listing]
    Provenance -->|label on или neutral marker| Wall
    Provenance -->|label on или neutral marker| Widget
    Project --> Tariff[Existing server tariff]
    Tariff -->|независимый badge_required| Widget
